	"Description": "llama.cpp packaged for Unreal Engine: GGUF model inference in-process on Win64 / Android / macOS / iOS, with Vulkan GPU offload on Win64 and Android and Metal on Apple platforms. Infrastructure, not a feature — it owns the runtime load order, backend registration and log routing, and exposes upstream's C API through a resolved function-pointer vtable.",
